# Minimal, read-only runtime for tools/radar_agent_query.py inside the
# openab-sidecar container (never the gateway -- see openab/README.md's
# two-container split). Deliberately excludes discord.py, fastapi,
# uvicorn, apscheduler, alembic, beautifulsoup4, and httpx -- the sidecar
# only ever opens a read-only DB session and formats query results; it
# never runs the crawler, scheduler, API, or Discord bot code. Kept in
# sync with the version ranges pinned in pyproject.toml.
